  "title": "Buffalo Tofu 'Wings'",
  "description": "An easy crowd-pleaser, these Buffalo tofu 'wings' are coated in a vegan dredge, pan-fried, and tossed in margarine and cayenne pepper sauce.",
  "authors": [
    "LucyDelRey"
  ],
  "date_published": "2018-01-19T03:24:02-05:00",
